# MS SQL → Laravel Table Mapping

> **MS SQL Server**: `localhost:51837` | **Database**: `chips`

---

## 1. Table-Level Mapping

| MS SQL Table | Laravel Table             | Laravel Model  | Purpose                        |
|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|--------------------------------|
| `CHSTFF`     | `sys_staff`               | `Staff`        | Employee/staff records         |
| `CHDEPT`     | `sys_set_departments`     | `Department`   | Departments                    |
| `CHDESN`     | `sys_set_staff_positions` | `Position`     | Job titles / Designations      |
| `CHBANK`     | `sys_set_banks`           | `Bank`         | Banks                          |
| `CHBBRA`     | *(no direct match)*       | —              | Bank branches                  |
| `CHGRDS`     | *(no direct match)*       | —              | Pay grades (MAN / NMA)         |
| `CHSNOK`     | `sys_staff` (embedded)    | `Staff`        | Next of kin (stored on staff)  |

