## 3. Key Data Differences

| Issue                    | MSSQL (chips)                              | Laravel (sys_staff)                     |
|--------------------------|--------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
| **Primary Keys**         | String codes (`EMPNUMB`, `DEPTCODE`)       | Auto-increment integers (`id`)          |
| **Foreign Keys**         | String codes stored directly               | Integer IDs referencing lookup tables   |
| **Salary**               | On staff record (`CHSTFF.SALBASC`)         | On position record (`Position.basic_salary`) |
| **Next of Kin**          | Separate table (`CHSNOK`) with multiples   | Single field on `sys_staff.kins_names`  |
| **Bank Branches**        | Separate table (`CHBBRA`)                  | Not tracked                             |
| **Grades**               | Separate table (`CHGRDS`)                  | Not tracked                             |
| **Zones / Zone Areas**   | Not in MSSQL                               | Separate tables with FK on staff        |

